/* ── Token 统计页 ────────────────────────:
/* ── Token stats page ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Every chart is hand-written SVG: the plugin pulls in no third-party chart library (one more dependency is one more coupling to the host version).
   Height is written as auto rather than a fixed value -- the viewBox carries the ratio, and a fixed height would stretch the chart or leave padding. */

/* ── 标签页：把原来一页到底的 7 张卡拆成 4 页 ──────────:
/* ── Tabs: split the original 7-card single page into 4 pages ────────────────────────
   The tab bar becomes a bordered container. The unselected state now uses **color** (it was opacity .7 -- 
   alpha both dimmed the text and left hover with no clear target),  and the current page uses an underline. */

/* 行内结果条：由**某一行上的按钮**触发的操作（切换 / 重登），结果必须:
/* Inline result bar: for actions triggered by **a button on one specific row** (switch / re-login), the result must stay on that row.
   Why (2026-09-30 user feedback "clicked switch, nothing happened, the error shows below, not obvious at all"):
   feedback used to write only the message at the card bottom, while the user's eyes were still on the button -- with a long list that is as good as no feedback. */

/* 账号行：从\"bg2 卡片里的凹陷块\"改成\"页面上的凸起块\"。\n:
/* Account row: changed from "a recessed block inside a bg2 card" to "a raised block on the page".
   With the card gone, bg1 matches the page and is invisible, so it must become bg2 -- which also makes the account library
   the only group on the page with a solid fill, so its importance surfaces on its own. */

/* 二级（子页面）标签：**分段胶囊**。\n 刻意和一级标签长得不一样（:
/* Secondary (sub-page) tabs: **segmented pills**.
   Deliberately shaped differently from the primary tabs (primary is "underline + large type") so you can tell at a glance which level you are on;
   otherwise the two levels look alike and users think they are back on the same level. */
